  "scope": "Unchanged on JDK 11, each case in a fresh class loader: CommunicationInfo, ClanRepository, ClanEntry, ClanMember, ClanRank, Contact, GlobalChat, ManagementEvents, ChatMessage, ContactPackets, CommunicationMessage, UpdateClanChat, ContactContext, MessageContext, ClanContext, IoBuffer, PacketHeader, Context, OutgoingPacket, PacketWriteQueue, Packet, StringUtils, CP1252, Globals, Util, Rights, UserAccountInfo, MSPacketRepository, ManagementServerState, ContentInterface, Privilege and all generated proto.management messages. Original text inserted at generation time: the social branches of PacketProcessor.process (AddFriend, RemoveFriend, AddIgnore, RemoveIgnore, JoinClan, SetClanRank, KickFromClan, ChatMessage, ChatSetting, PrivateMessage), PacketProcessor.splitChatMessage and BASE_CHAT_CUTOFF; the ten social decoders of Decoders530 and its companion process; Login.sendMSEvents; Player getName, getCommunication, getUsername and sendLogoutEvents; Node getName; PlayerDetails accountInfo and communicationInfo fields, constructor, isMuted, getRights, getCommunication, getUsername and getDetails; Settings player and three chat fields, both updateChatSettings, getPublicChatSetting, getPrivateChatSetting and getTradeSetting; PacketRepository.send; Repository.getPlayerByName; WorldCommunicator state field and isEnabled; ContentAPI getAttribute and setAttribute; the Log enum. Recording adapters: attributes, action locks, the mask registry, game messages, interface strings and opening, varps, the pulse queue, logging, PlayerMonitor, account storage and the authenticator, command registration, the session write and outgoing cipher, the management-server session, the clan war activity, the repository player list and name map (case order). kotlinx.coroutines is a stand-in that runs the management coroutine on the calling thread when the case pumps it and stops it instead of blocking on an empty queue. Wall-clock reads and unseeded java.util.Random constructions are redirected call sites answered by the case (census below). UserAccountInfo.default is initialized before each case is recorded. Not exercised: real dispatcher threads, the socket, the management server, quick chat, clan wars, AIPlayer chat (PacketRepository never queues for a bot) and MessageLog.",
